98</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"88204e0b-a61b-4ed7-ba98-4fcc53be0768","uuid":"1cb8777f-e882-4413-87c0-cfea5424ca22","timestamp":"2026-05-17T02:49:46.880Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"You are writing markdown task brief files for a build harness. Do NOT implement the feature itself — just write the brief markdown files.\n\nRepo root: /home/pete/cadres/lattice\nSpec: /home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md  (READ Phases 10 and 11 + §Human Review Surface + §Documentation Requirements + §Testing Requirements + §Measurable Success Criteria + §Risks)\nContext: /home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/context.md\nTasks JSON: /home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks.json\nShared standards: /home/pete/cadres/shared/templates/coding.md AND /home/pete/cadres/shared/templates/ui-specification.md (READ FOR T71–T77 — frontend tasks must honor this) AND /home/pete/cadres/shared/templates/definition-of-done-checklist.md (READ FOR R88 — that review walks the entire checklist).\n\nWrite these 19 files at `/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/<TASK_ID>.md`:\n\nT71, T72, T73, T74, T75, T76, T77, R78, R79, T80, T81, T82, T83, T84, T85, T86, R87, R88, R89\n\n**Use the same template structure as prior agents.**\n\nFor frontend tasks (T71–T77), the \"Coding-standard checks\" section MUST add a \"UI specification\" subsection covering:\n- All user-facing strings via `i18n.t(...)` (no inline literals).\n- All modals via native `<dialog>` (no `window.confirm/prompt/alert`).\n- All mutation handlers use `try/catch` with `parseApiError(e)` + `toast.error(...)` if applicable to extension context — for VS Code extension, use `vscode.window.showErrorMessage(err.message)` where `parseApiError` does not apply.\n- All ID inputs use `SearchableSelect` (where applicable to VS Code webview